{"title":"2003 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 19","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How many integers between 1000 and 2000 have all three of the numbers 15, 20, and 25 as factors?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/d/d4de85cf3f5978446555260f2de6dbc927a7bfac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 1 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 2 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 3 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 4 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"348\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the least common multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/7/1272e208cbc6c39fa356ff489f91881e7203423a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15, 20, 25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"70\" height=\"16\" /> by turning the numbers into their prime factorization. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/e/c5e3d5f50e128598ff732c82049c293cc0c2dab6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[15 = 3 \\cdot 5, 20 = 2^2 \\cdot 5, 25 = 5^2\\]\" width=\"227\" height=\"19\" /> Gather all necessary multiples \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/8/0d8eb498fbcb4d413d9287fd0920182eec878493.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3, 2^2, 5^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"57\" height=\"18\" /> when multiplied gets <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/9/b899aba26cc33f0026125daebb44a60349c999b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$300$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" />. The multiples of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/2/34269b7810bf4b929efd61b30958d2eb0d287c1a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$300 - 300, 600, 900, 1200, 1500, 1800, 2100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"324\" height=\"16\" />. The number of multiples between 1000 and 2000 is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/8/c88676177603d4e7134e7819bb31db2c8ca62f28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_8\" title=\"2003 AMC 8\">2003 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2003 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2003 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2003\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2003 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2003 AMC 